<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 120 bln yen of 0.7 pct two-year notes.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 120 bln yen of 0.7 pct two-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance offered 120 billion yen of 0.7 percent two-year notes through a price competitive auction on Thursday.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be May 20, 1997 and the maturity date will be May 20, 1999.</p>
</text>
